## Stop conditions

- Plan shows any resource besides the two policies, any change/destroy, or any
  statement differing from the reviewed text → STOP.
- Policy-create API error (e.g., syntax rejection of
  `in compartment id <tenancy-ocid>`) → STOP; do not fall back to
  `in tenancy` or any broader location without a new approval
  (../b5-mysql-nsg-diagnosis.md §8).
- Anything else unexpected → STOP, preserve logs.

